        <p class="section-kicker">Strategic Sourcing</p>
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-3">Intelligent Supplier Selection & Procurement</h2>
        <p>
            Strategic sourcing transforms procurement from a transactional activity into a competitive
            advantage. The system evaluates suppliers across quality, reliability, pricing, and risk
            dimensions — enabling data-driven decisions about where to allocate spend and how to
            structure supplier relationships for long-term value.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-0">
            Procurement automation eliminates manual purchase order creation through configurable
            approval workflows, reorder point triggers, and blanket order agreements. Spend analytics
            identify consolidation opportunities and highlight supplier concentration risks before
            they impact operations.
        </p>
    </div>
